  "description": "The Shavano is Monday’s step-through version of the classic Community & Campus commuter. It’s built for smooth weekday rides and easy weekend exploration, with the freedom to ride your way.\nDesigned for comfort, control, and everyday confidence, the Shavano features adjustable front suspension, an adjustable seat post, a padded spring saddle, raised handlebars, spoke wheels, and hydraulic brakes. Integrated safety features include a powerful LED headlight, rear taillight, brake light, turn signals, and reflectors all around.\nPowered by a Bafang rear hub motor and a high-capacity 48V 20Ah battery, the Shavano is easy to ride, easy to handle, and ready for wherever the pavement meets the trail. Ruggedly built with aircraft-grade aluminum, stainless fasteners, and water-resistant connectors, it is made to last.\nThe Shavano also supports popular trailers, making it simple to carry groceries, sports gear, or everything needed for a ride to the park.",
